/09/MlQUJEWCfM4.jpg","name":"MlQUJEWCfM4.jpg","status":"success","createdAt":1631880913,"updatedAt":1631880913},"title":"Examine the code of the Stepping Down procedure","taskType":"basic","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"155e2727-fa33-402d-a8fd-2b0122a19c69","url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2021/09/64qWxnkt8G0.jpg","text":"The script of the Stepping Right procedure is very similar to the script of the Stepping Down procedure. But now the X coordinate should be changing.\n\n For how many points should the X coordinate be changing to move the MarsBot 1 square right without touching the Martian sand?","type":"gif","image":{"id":161615,"uid":1631880966991,"url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2021/09/64qWxnkt8G0.jpg","name":"64qWxnkt8G0.jpg","status":"success","createdAt":1631880966,"updatedAt":1631880966},"title":"Write a script for the Stepping Right procedure","taskType":"basic","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"8bb18d06-54a0-48ab-b1e3-38be6efeb1e3","url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2021/09/YQ6PxpmXAK.gif","text":"Add it to the end of the Green Flag Is Checked basic script.","type":"gif","image":{"id":161616,"uid":1631881010075,"url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2021/09/YQ6PxpmXAK.gif","name":"YQ6PxpmXAK.gif","status":"success","createdAt":1631881009,"updatedAt":1631881009},"title":"How can we test the procedure operation?","taskType":"basic","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"b0d7e0ea-0486-43ea-b3f1-614a20395883","url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2021/09/64qWxnkt8G0_1631881035.jpg","text":"The script of the Stepping Up procedure is very similar to the script of the Stepping Down procedure. \n\nFor how many points should the Y coordinate be changing to move the MarsBot 1 square up without touching the Martian sand?","type":"gif","image":{"id":161617,"uid":1631881035525,"url":"/vp-assets/uploads/2021/09/64qWxnkt8G0_1631881035.jpg","name":"64qWxnkt8G0.jpg","status":"success","createdAt":1631881035,"updatedAt":1631881035},"title":"Write a script for the Stepping Up procedure","taskType":"bas